-- The citation catalogue's second version, unauthored, at catalogue/4, under the fixed identifier the
-- domain's `DEFAULT_CATALOGUE_VERSIONS.citation` gives it: inserted only where the catalogue's latest is
-- still 0024's first - by its identifier and content hash, unauthored - with nothing after it, and
